    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "that's a really strong start. i like the energy. how should we handle the sections on the indigenous tribes and the conflicts that happened during the expansion? should we include them in this intro or keep them for later exhibits so we don't break the momentum of the 'progress' theme?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
