      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It is essential to integrate the perspective of the Indigenous communities, as their inherent right to the land is central to the full story of the West. A strong, nuanced introduction should acknowledge the profound impact of this expansion on the First Nations, framing the \"progress\" of one group against the devastating reality for others. This approach will create a more powerful and responsible narrative for the entire exhibit, moving beyond a simplified story of triumph.",
      "source": "target",
